$n$ & height-two posets & one-bit cases & neutral nonredundant & repair-forest cases \\
\midrule
3 & 1 & 8 & 2 & 2 \\
4 & 13 & 208 & 50 & 50 \\
5 & 172 & 5,504 & 1,232 & 1,232 \\
6 & 2,787 & 178,368 & 36,783 & 36,783 \\
