& $\lambda(\lambda+1)$
& $|1\rangle$ has eigenvalue $1$; $|0\rangle$ has eigenvalue $0$
& idempotent projection in the $\F_2$ linear-algebra sense.\\
$[\Leftrightarrow]=I$
& $(\lambda+1)^2$
& every nonzero vector has eigenvalue $1$
& identity operator.\\
