\title{Hierarchical Concepts Under Finite Resolution:\\
Ultrametric Geometry, Observational Equivalence, and Symmetry\\
\large Working draft of ``Paper U''}
\author{Brian Droncheff}
\date{Draft v0.1 --- September 2026}

